{"budget":{"remaining_candidate_slots":0,"remaining_rounds":0,"remaining_search_calls":0,"remaining_tool_calls":0},"conversation_context":"回答必须区分页级事实、学习建议和证据缺口。","current_user_query":"考试前请帮我完成这一步：解释当前页，并给出一个可执行的复习动作。对象是《CAD-电路分析与设计-2021真题》，本轮还剩 19 分钟；最终只返回一个 JSON 对象。","force_final":true,"has_image":false,"instruction":"工具预算已结束；依据现有只读观察输出最终 JSON。","platform_term_glossary":{"CPS":["通信原理"],"大物":["大学物理"],"线代":["线性代数"]},"routing_state":{"budget_phase":"must_finish","candidate_phase":"not_observed","evidence_phase":"available","memory_phase":"not_loaded","must_finish_without_tools":true,"version":"studyhub.router.state.v1"},"search_history":[],"task_context":{"constraints":["只使用免费资料","不超出可见页级证据"],"course_terms":["电路分析"],"exam_goal":"依据页级证据理解并复习资料","resource_types":["真题"],"time_budget":{"daily_hours":1.0,"days_until_exam":5}},"tool_observations":[{"result":{"available":true,"evidence":[{"chunk_id":"26:preview_vlm:3:3c3071f2506d","evidence_id":"26:preview_vlm:3:3c3071f2506d","material_id":26,"page":3,"text":"(4) Calculate the impedance of an RL series element with R=500Ω and L=20mH at the operating frequency of 2 kHz. [4] A. 500+j400Ω B. 500+j251.3Ω C. 500+j0.025Ω D. 500-j1.98Ω (5) Before a transient event at t=0+, what is the value of the voltage across an inductor if a generic circuit having DC input has been at steady state for a long time? [3] A. Equal to the integral of the current B. Equal to inductance multiplied by the integral of the current C. Equal to the product of the current and the inductance D. None of the above answers are correct (6) For the sinusoidal signal given in figure below, phase angle at t=0 is [3] A. 0° B. -30° C. -45° D. -60° (7) In the following circuit, the resistor is R=4kΩ and the capacitor is C=0.5μF, what is the value of the time constant? [3] Page 3 of 8","title":"CAD-电路分析与设计-2021真题"}],"requested_material_ids":[26],"requested_page_numbers":[3]},"tool":"read_pdf_evidence"}]}<|im_end|>
