{"answer":"### 本页结论\nThe page contains four questions related to electrical engineering, specifically focusing on impedance calculations, inductor voltage, phase angles, and time constants. The text includes multiple-choice options and a graph for question 6. The page is part of a larger document, indicated by 'Page 3 of 8'.\n\n### 可核对内容\n(4) Calculate the impedance of an RL series element with R=500Ω and L=20mH at the operating frequency of 2 kHz. [4] A. 500+j400Ω B. 500+j251.3Ω C. 500+j0.025Ω D. 500-j1.98Ω (5) Before a transient event at t=0+, what is the value of the voltage across an inductor if a generic circuit having DC input has been at steady state for a long time? [3] A. Equal to the integral of the current B. Equal to inductance multiplied。\n\n### 复习动作\n合上资料复述三个要点，再回看原页核对遗漏。以上结论只覆盖第 3 页可见内容。","evidence_sources":[{"chunk_id":"26:preview_vlm:3:3c3071f2506d","material_id":26,"page":3,"title":"CAD-电路分析与设计-2021真题"}],"followup_questions":["继续读取《CAD-电路分析与设计-2021真题》相邻页面","把当前内容改成主动回忆清单"],"mode":"final","recommendations":[],"task_context":{"constraints":["只使用免费资料","不超出可见页级证据"],"course_terms":["电路分析"],"exam_goal":"依据页级证据理解并复习资料","resource_types":["真题"],"time_budget":{"daily_hours":1.0,"days_until_exam":5}}}<|im_end|>

